 Requires Python 3.9+; `tmux_check.py` also needs tmux. Pin runs to idle cores with `--cpus` for stable figures. See
 [docs/BENCHMARKS.md](../docs/BENCHMARKS.md) for methodology and results.
 
+### Text in the charts
+
+`report.py` writes text that can come from outside the tool into its SVGs: build names and `--label` text, labels from
+`environment.txt`, panel and chart titles. Each such value is XML-escaped once where it is written (text nodes and quoted
+attributes alike), and characters XML 1.0 forbids are dropped, so a label cannot inject elements, attributes or script and
+Unicode is kept as is. Labels are stored raw and escaped only at output, so a value is never escaped twice. Tests:
+`python3 -m unittest discover -s bench -p 'test_report.py' -v`.
+
 ## Windows
 
 The tools run on Windows 10 2004 or later with Python from python.org (`winproc.py`): every process in a Job object of its own
